Package: microd
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: iproute2, systemd
Recommends: debootstrap
Maintainer: microd maintainers <noreply@a10k.internal>
Description: microVM orchestrator daemon
 microd runs multiple KVM-backed microVMs under a single process,
 with an S3-backed root filesystem and a transport-agnostic IPC
 surface. Ships with the microctl CLI and golden-upload build tool.
 .
 See /usr/local/share/microd/README for deployment notes.
